    - target: {fileID: 1000012607288206, guid: c1621f4dd1e8c2748a5a423aa7736d55, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_IsActive
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1000013620782116, guid: c1621f4dd1e8c2748a5a423aa7736d55, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_IsActive
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 114000010683909002, guid: c1621f4dd1e8c2748a5a423aa7736d55,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Text
      value: 'Interactions:

        - Axe chops down invasive tree (onces with particles) after collision

        - Spray can remove invasive tree rings and stumps with particle collisions

        - Invasive plant (Red Outline) can be grabbed and placed in compost machine
        and a native seed will dispense, a fact and picture is also displayed

        - Seeds can grabbed and planted in garden plot and a fact is also displayed

        - Removal of invasives plants reduces fog and transitions to lighter ambiance

        - Planting seeds lightens the sky'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 114000010683909002, guid: c1621f4dd1e8c2748a5a423aa7736d55,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_FontData.m_FontSize
      value: 96
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 114000010683909002, guid: c1621f4dd1e8c2748a5a423aa7736d55,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_FontData.m_MaxSize
      value: 96
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 114000010683909002, guid: c1621f4dd1e8c2748a5a423aa7736d55,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_FontData.m_Alignment
      value: 3
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 114000011111918770, guid: c1621f4dd1e8c2748a5a423aa7736d55,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Text
      value: 'Controls:

        - Once tool is grabbed (atleast once initially) press Right to switch tool

        - Press Left to respawn tool in front of you

        - When hovering over object shows outline Hold X to grab

        - Once an invasive plant is grabbed hold Down to pull it towards you

        - To simulate removal of all invasive species press Up to reverse press Up
        again



'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 114000011111918770, guid: c1621f4dd1e8c2748a5a423aa7736d55,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_FontData.m_FontSize
      value: 96
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 114000011111918770, guid: c1621f4dd1e8c2748a5a423aa7736d55,
